@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
title Set a rate: student command component

participant ":StudentCommands" as Commands
participant ":TutorLedgerData" as Data
participant "original:Student" as Original
participant "edited:Student" as Edited

[-> Commands : execute("edit S1 r/60")
activate Commands
Commands -> Data : getStudent("S1")
Data --> Commands : original
Commands -> Original : withDetails(...)
create Edited
Original -> Edited : new Student(...)
Original --> Commands : edited copy
Commands -> Edited : withDefaultHourlyRate("60")
Edited --> Commands : updated copy
note over Commands, Edited
  Validate a replacement before storing it.
  The original stays unchanged on failure.
end note
Commands -> Data : replaceStudent(updated)
Data --> Commands
Commands -->[ : confirmation
deactivate Commands
note over Commands, Edited
  After execute returns, TutorLedger calls
  StorageCommands.saveIfChanged(before).
end note
@enduml
